{%- comment -%}
  NURVA PERFORMANCE — About page section.

  Online Store -> Themes -> Edit code -> Sections -> Add a new section,
  name it  nurva-about  (Shopify adds the .liquid), paste this in, Save.

  Then either:
  A) Online Store -> Pages -> Add page, name it About, set its theme
     template to a new one (e.g. page.about), and add this section to it
     in Customize -> pick the About page -> Add section -> Nurva about.
  B) Or just add it to any existing page/template the same way.
  Pick your product in the section settings once added.

  Same look and behaviour as the homepage: hero, story split, values,
  a real Buy 1 Get 1 Free purchase block, and FAQ. Styles are scoped
  under .nurva and cannot affect the rest of your theme.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign bp = section.settings.product -%}
{%- assign bpv = bp.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}

